{"metadata":{"title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","externalID":"c:objc(cs)EXPPredictive(cm)checkIfEligibleForSurvey","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":true,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"EXPPredictive"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to be eligible, a number of conditions must be fulfilled:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The library is in an enabled state. If the user has previously declined an invite","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or completed a survey, the library will be in a disabled state. Otherwise, the library is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in an enabled state.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user has met the loyalty threshold defined in your exp_configuration.json file."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user is in the sampling pool. If the previous two conditions have been met, the library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes an HTTP call to our servers to determine if the user is in the sampling pool. If s\/he is,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the invite will be presented. If not, the invite will not be shown. Disable this remote check with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"setSkipPoolingCheck:","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive","doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive":{"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive","type":"topic","title":"EXPPredictive","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive"},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive/checkIfEligibleForSurvey":{"title":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.Verint.EXPPredictive\/documentation\/EXPPredictive\/EXPPredictive\/checkIfEligibleForSurvey","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Checks to see if the user is currently eligible to be invited to a survey.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/exppredictive\/exppredictive\/checkifeligibleforsurvey","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkIfEligibleForSurvey"}]},"doc://com.Verint.EXPPredictive/documentation/EXPPredictive/EXPPredictive":{"abstract":[{"text":"The EXPPredictive class provides the main interface to the Verint EXPPredictive module. You must add a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"